{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d1d12e53-52e5-882d-9ec8-1bd19f5ae4e3",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T18:14:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Helena Amaral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:09:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise, yes, hello. I know it's after hours, City Hall's closed, I got the recording that said to press two for the storm line, so I hope this is the right place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:10:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're in the right place. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:10:15-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street is flooded again. On Rhode Island Avenue, down near my building, number 376. It did the same thing last month, and now after that snow-to-rain mess, Sunday into Monday, it's back. Nobody ever does anything about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:10:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 376 Rhode Island Avenue. Is the water in the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, the house is fine, it stayed dry, thank goodness. I manage it, I'm the property manager. It's just the street. There's this big pond right at the corner and the drain is just sitting there, not taking anything. And the water's creeping toward the neighbor's garage. It's, um, the door's low, and I keep watching it come closer. Sorry, I'm in the car, hold on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:11:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Is the water actually at the garage door yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:11:08-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet. About, I don't know, ten feet off? It's moving slow but it's moving. And it's the second time in a month I've called about this, well, not called, I meant to call last time and then I didn't, and then, ha, what was I saying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:11:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The water heading for the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:11:31-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Thank you. So, quick question, is that a city drain or a state one? Because somebody told me Rhode Island Avenue might be state, and I don't want to be calling the wrong people over and over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:11:47-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Most of the drains on city streets are ours, so I'll log it as a city drain with a note to check. If it turns out to be state, we pass it along to them ourselves. You don't have to chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:12:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh good. That's a relief, honestly. I was going to spend my whole evening on hold with somebody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:12:13-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not tonight. I'm putting it in as a blocked storm drain with water spreading toward a neighboring garage, so it gets looked at first. Is it still raining or is it just standing water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:12:27-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just standing. It stopped raining yesterday. But the drain's got leaves and slush and who knows what packed on top of it. I can see the grate, kind of, from the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:12:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's helpful. Can you give me a cross street so the crew finds the right corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:12:48-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, it's the corner just up from my building, toward the hill side. Oh, what's the cross street, Spring? No. Hold on, I'm blanking. Ha. I'll say it's the corner two doors up from 376, on the same side as the white garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:13:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. And a callback number in case the crew needs to find you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:13:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0184."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0184. Helena, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:13:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Helena Amaral, yes. Two A's, no, one A at the start and one at the end. Amaral."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:13:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. It's in the queue for the morning run. If it gets bad before then, call back and say the water's reached the garage, and we'll bump it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:13:38-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll keep an eye on it. I've got to run anyway, I'm picking up flowers before the shop shuts. It's my friend's anniversary and I'm already late. Ha, tulips, I think. Or I don't know, whatever's left."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:13:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, hurry, then. Hope they like them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:13:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Denise. Just, please, somebody actually come this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:14:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got it logged, Helena. Drive safe."
    }
  ],
